OL,3,AFrench PM asks some cities to impose
OL,4,Apartial curfews after 'violent'
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome French cities have been given the
OL,8,Fpower to implement partial curfews to
OL,9,Fprotect people and shops, says PM
OL,10,FSebastien Lecornu
OL,12,FIt comes after a weekend of riots and
OL,13,Flooting, with Lecornu saying people
OL,14,Fwant to know "how this violence came
OL,15,Fabout in our country"
OL,17,FEarlier, France's Interior Minister
OL,18,FLaurent Nunez said police had "lost
OL,19,Fcontrol" - the head of France's
OL,20,FChambers of Commerce and Industry says
OL,21,F2,000 businesses were directly impacted
OL,22,Fby the demonstrations
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
