OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792409175
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrench PM asks some cities to impose
OL,4,Apartial curfews after 'violent'
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FNunez, whose offer of resignation has
OL,8,Fbeen rejected by French President
OL,9,FEmmanuel Macron, said there was a "lack
OL,10,Fof anticipation" from officers
OL,12,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,13,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,14,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,15,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,17,FLecornu says the movement is being led
OL,18,Fby "ultra-left radical groups" hoping
OL,19,Fto "create chaos" ahead of the 2027
OL,20,FFrench presidential elections
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
