OL,3,AInside the shadowy world of anti-Putin
OL,4,Asabotage from within Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Russian men secretly working for
OL,7,FUkraine's intelligence services have
OL,8,Fgiven rare accounts of operations they
OL,9,Fclaim to have been involved with, that
OL,10,Fhave targeted military assets and
OL,11,Fpersonnel inside Russia.
OL,13,FOne of the men, whom we are calling
OL,14,FIvan, claims to have played a role from
OL,15,FRussia in Ukrainian drone attacks on
OL,16,Fstrategic bombers and munitions
OL,17,Ffactories on his home soil.
OL,19,FHe features in a BBC World Service
OL,20,Fdocumentary about the shadowy world of
OL,21,FRussian saboteurs.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
